# Plan Implementation — Frontend

## Structure

Split new UI into small files or sections inside one file:

- `init()` / state
- `fetchApi()` — HTTP only
- `render*()` — DOM only
- `bindEvents()` — listeners

Do not add **>80 lines** of new logic inline in `project_delivery.js` without extracting functions.

## Chinese & encoding

- UI copy: 简体中文 via `messages.json` or template — not hardcoded Latin placeholders in production paths
- Prefer `textContent` / template literals; avoid fragile quote concatenation (see safe-change-workflow)
- After edit: `node --check` on changed `.js`

## API interaction

- Reuse existing CSRF token injection pattern from sibling pages
- Errors: show user-readable 中文 (`加载失败：…`), log detail to console

## Plan UI Steps (P1-02 wizard, P1-03 badges)

- One screen = one render function
- Loading / success / fail states required (safe-change-workflow §4)
